2: all goon×8.\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17\",\"uuid\":\"170a7280-089a-4b66-a0bb-1fa357aba2d7\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T01:44:54.772Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"file\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/work/PLAN.md\",\"content\":\"\\n**3-4 PENTHOUSE VAULT** (par 80)\\n- A safe is built into the north wall between cx 7 and 13, with 4 lock bolts (`lock`, HP 15) at [6,0] [9,0] [11,0]\\n  [14,0].\\n- When all 4 break, the safe door swings open and the key plus 10 cash pickups spill out.\\n- W1 @2: all goon×8.\",\"numLines\":6,\"startLine\":816,\"totalLines\":1995}},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01T4UPmKnign1RYqXSuw97HC\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}","+{\"type\":\"rate_limit_event\",\"rate_limit_info\":{\"status\":\"allowed\",\"resetsAt\":1793793600,\"rateLimitType\":\"seven_day\",\"overageStatus\":\"rejected\",\"overageDisabledReason\":\"org_level_disabled\",\"isUsingOverage\":false,\"unifiedWindows\":{\"seven_day\":{\"utilization\":0.45,\"resetsAt\":1793793600,\"status\":\"allowed\"}}},\"uuid\":\"7d5bb758-8165-4f7e-b975-b9600d27acdb\",\"session_id\":\"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17\"}"]}]}],"moreFiles":5,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-184315__x1295cd/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174737__x193f88/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183848__x1295cd/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__2026