r 1 has the whole keyboard back when no one shares it","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work/PLAN.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":474,"oldLines":7,"newStart":474,"newLines":8,"lines":[" loops hold when you're fast and drop you when you're slow — TrackMania's feel — and it's deterministic."," "," State (engine units): `p` (chassis reference point: centre of the wheelbase, `ride` above the road), `v`, frame","-`f, u` (r derived), `grounded`, `n` (surface normal last step), `kappa` (filtered curvature), `slip` (detach timer),","+`f, u` (r derived), `grounded`, `n` (surface normal last step), `kappa` (filtered curvature), `load` (normal load per","+unit mass), `slip` (detach timer),"," `air` (seconds airborne), `flop` (crash-recovery timer), `boostT`, `drift`, `surface`, `blockId`, per-wheel `d` (for"," drawing suspension), `steerVis`, `slide` (for FX/sound), `impact` (last impact speed)."," "]},{"oldStart":1243,"oldLines":7,"newStart":1244,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | --- | --- |"," | `turtle` | every track and puzzle program compiles; no overlaps; in bounds; expected CP counts; kicker→landing links; puzzle fixed blocks equal the solution's ST/CP/FN cells; inventories cover the solutions |"," | `blocks` | every block type: path is C0/C1 continuous (Δp < 1 cm, Δt < 0.5° between samples), unit t/u, u ⊥ t; mesh has no NaN; Rapier winding normals agree with u (dot > 0.5) and three winding is the reverse; **every link in every shipped track**: port frames match (1 cm, 0.5°) |","-| `physics` | (Coyote unless noted) 0→100 km/h in 2.6–3.6 s; reaches ≥ 97% vtop on a long straight; 100→0 braking in 12–22 m; R2 at 110 km/h holds the lane, R1 at 110 km/h runs wide (needs braking); **loop block on full throttle from ≥ 60 km/h: grounded all the way, exits upright; from ≤ 40 km/h: detaches at","+| `physics` | (Coyote unless noted) 0→100 km/h in 2.3–3.3 s; reaches ≥ 97% vtop on a long straight; 100→0 braking in 12–22 m; R2 at 90 km/h holds the lane, R2 at 130 km/h and R1 at 80 km/h run wide (they need braking); BR2 holds at 150 km/h; **loop block on full throttle from ≥ 60 km/h: grounded all the way, exits upright; from ≤ 40 km/h: detaches at"," the top; coasting from ≥ 115 km/h holds, ≤ 95 km/h fails** (re-measure and update these numbers if tuning changes);"," ice: acceleration capped by traction (≤ 0.35 × asphalt's from standstill); U1 crest at 120 km/h: airborne; kicker at the D2 approach: lands on the landing; wall at 100 km/h at 30°: no penetration, speed kept 40–90%; ice cornering speed < 70% of asphalt's; boost pad adds ≥ 9 m/s; flop recovers upright within 1 s; respawn → at the CP, v = 0, upright; 10 s of identical inputs twice → identical state hash |"," | `race` | CPs count once each, in any order, either direction; finish refused before all CPs (\"MISSING CHECKPOINT\"); clock runs through respawns; restart resets; splits and deltas vs best; medal thresholds from author (1.06/1.2/1.5 with rounding); results rewards paid once per tier; records saved |"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work/PLAN.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01F8BRqK2NpNshjXKC5J9NHE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
