{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DdN7huBPnCPfW5Kff5xapU","type":"tool_result","content":"675:- `rig.solvePose()`: set the joints J from the rig's state this step (update and setPose call it); a clip player may wrap it on one rig: const base = rig.solvePose; rig.solvePose = function () { base.call(this); ...move J... }\n678:- `rig.worldOffset(p)`: where a point in the rig's own frame ([forward, right, up]; a joint such as rig.J.head, or one offset from it) sits, in world units from the rig's feet: add rig.x, y, z for the world point, or project it to draw at a joint\n680:- `rig.J`: its joints this step in its own frame ({ hipL, kneeL, footL, shC, head, handR, ... }; rig.worldOffset(J.handR) gives one in the world)\n4162:  solvePose() {","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c87f55d5-27de-4595-aefb-732ca102ecfb","uuid":"419dc518-78c6-43e9-ab0f-2764d49deca3","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:47:39.420Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"675:- `rig.solvePose()`: set the joints J from the rig's state this step (update and setPose call it); a clip player may wrap it on one rig: const base = rig.solvePose; rig.solvePose = function () { base.call(this); ...move J... }\n678:- `rig.worldOffset(p)`: where a point in the rig's own frame ([forward, right, up]; a joint such as rig.J.head, or one offset from it) sits, in world units from the rig's feet: add rig.x, y, z for the world point, or project it to draw at a joint\n680:- `rig.J`: its joints this step in its own frame ({ hipL, kneeL, footL, shC, head, handR, ... }; rig.worldOffset(J.handR) gives one in the world)\n4162:  solvePose() {","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183420__xf7f297/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":323,"oldLines":3,"newStart":323,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"est