{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EkpL9jTX1hEgH8d8Mkz6dN","type":"tool_result","content":"1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n1108:- `talk.close()`: close it now (and forget pending presses, so the same press doesn't also attack)\n1109:- `talk.draw(r)`: draw it (anywhere in draw: it goes to the overlay)\n1111:- `talk.say(text, o = {})`: open with one string or a list of strings (each starts a new page). opts: { name, onDone, choices, onChoice, portrait: rig (a live close-up of that Humanoid beside the text) or a function (g, x, y, size), portraitSize: 40, port\n1113:- `talk.update(dt)`: type and turn pages (confirm finishes the line, then turns the page); returns true while open and modal, so gameplay can wait: if (talk.update(dt)) return;\n1127:- `talk.open = false`: true while it shows\n1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\n276:- `input.anyPressed()`: any action pressed this step (title screens: \"press any button\")\n285:- `input.consumeAll()`: forget every pending press (after closing a menu or dialog, so the same press does not also attack)\n287:- `input.down(a)`: is the action held right now?\n306:- `input.repeat(a, delay = .3, rate = .08)`: pressed, then repeats while held (after `delay` s, every `rate` s): menu cursors, puzzle pieces\n471:- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) c\n[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: src/60-audio.js. Call Read before editing.]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c87f55d5-27de-4595-aefb-732ca102ecfb","uuid":"81bd7477-c469-4141-8f45-d64fcc2a48f8","timestamp":"2026-1